  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support Strategic Investments and Productive Transformation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a Inversiones Estratgicas y Transformacin Productiva</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support the Guatemalan governments efforts to continue boosting the productivity of the economy in general and of businesses in particular, especially micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises. The purpose is to contribute to remove that limits the development of business and investment; and to boost the productivity of businesses in sectors and regions or areas that are considered priorities for the country.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
